{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "auth0_api_python"}], "prev": {"link": "../", "title": "auth0_api_python"}, "next": {"link": "../api_client/", "title": "auth0_api_python.api_client"}, "title": "auth0_api_python.act", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_api_python.act\">\n<span id=\"auth0-api-python-act\"></span><h1>auth0_api_python.act<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_api_python.act\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Helpers for working with the <cite>act</cite> claim on verified access token claims.</p>\n<section id=\"attributes\">\n<h2>Attributes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#attributes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.INVALID_ACT_CLAIM_MESSAGE\" title=\"auth0_api_python.act.INVALID_ACT_CLAIM_MESSAGE\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">INVALID_ACT_CLAIM_MESSAGE</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"functions\">\n<h2>Functions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#functions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.get_current_actor\" title=\"auth0_api_python.act.get_current_actor\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">get_current_actor</span></code></a>(\u2192\u00a0Optional[str])</p></td>\n<td><p>Return the current actor from the outermost <cite>act.sub</cite>, if present.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.get_delegation_chain\" title=\"auth0_api_python.act.get_delegation_chain\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">get_delegation_chain</span></code></a>(\u2192\u00a0list[str])</p></td>\n<td><p>Return the delegation chain from newest actor to oldest actor.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.act.INVALID_ACT_CLAIM_MESSAGE\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.act.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">INVALID_ACT_CLAIM_MESSAGE</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'Invalid</span> <span class=\"pre\">act</span> <span class=\"pre\">claim'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.INVALID_ACT_CLAIM_MESSAGE\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.act.get_current_actor\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.act.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_current_actor</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">claims</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Mapping</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.get_current_actor\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the current actor from the outermost <cite>act.sub</cite>, if present.</p>\n<p>Only the outermost <cite>act.sub</cite> should be used for authorization decisions.\nNested <cite>act</cite> values represent prior actors and are informational.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.act.get_delegation_chain\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.act.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_delegation_chain</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">claims</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Mapping</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.get_delegation_chain\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the delegation chain from newest actor to oldest actor.</p>\n<p>The first entry is the current actor (outermost <cite>act.sub</cite>). Later entries are\nprior actors from nested <cite>act</cite> values and are typically most useful for audit\nand attribution.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/api_client/index", "auth0_api_python.api_client", "N", "next"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/index", "auth0_api_python", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/act/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">auth0_api_python.act</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#attributes\">Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#functions\">Functions</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.INVALID_ACT_CLAIM_MESSAGE\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">INVALID_ACT_CLAIM_MESSAGE</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.get_current_actor\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">get_current_actor()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.act.get_delegation_chain\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">get_delegation_chain()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/act/index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}